Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:21.32,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1000,4720,5320)\pos(640,536)}Liu Bei Seeks the Virtuous
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:19.06,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:19.98,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:26.10,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:26.69,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.75,0:03:32.54,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.91,0:03:50.07,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:04:00.82,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Sir, why have you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:07.04,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I was passing through when a boy led me to visit your esteemed presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.16,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I feel honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:15.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6000,6400)\pos(283.663,487.2)}Sīmǎ Huī\NStyled: Décāo
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:12.28,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Sire, you shouldn't keep secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:18.14,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,You're here today in order to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:28.88,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5500,5800)\pos(934.556,485.381)}Liú Bèi\N Styled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:28.88,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,To be honest with you, Liu Biao had me host a meeting in Xiangyang for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:34.56,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,but Cai Mao tried to harm me, so I fled the meeting and came by this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:38.28,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,I gathered that from your facial expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:42.41,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,I have heard of your great reputation, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.50,0:04:48.68,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Why is it that to this day, \Nyou have no foundations of your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:55.34,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Fate is fickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.34,0:04:56.84,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,That is why I am here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:59.02,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.06,0:05:03.04,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:09.83,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord8}The reason why you have not yet \Naccomplished your great undertaking
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.83,0:05:15.40,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}is because you lack virtuous sage men to assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.22,0:05:23.18,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I may not be able, but following me are officials Sun Qian, Mi Zhu, and Jian Yong,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.18,0:05:25.78,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and generals Yunchang, Yide, and Zilong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:29.72,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}They are devoted and loyal, how could you not count them as such men?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.40,0:05:33.86,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, why are you laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.24,0:05:40.50,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Guan Yu, Zhang Fei, and Zhao Yun are warriors who rival ten thousand men.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.43,0:05:45.50,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What a pity that they are not made more use of.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:07.50,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sun Qian, Jian Yong, and Mi Zhu are inexpert literati.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:10.90,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Not men of grand strategies and statesmanship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.60,0:06:18.84,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Mister, your words are most correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.84,0:06:22.26,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I did search for such able men before, from areas of seclusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:26.02,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but never encountered a man of such talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:30.52,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir Xuande, is it not as how Confucius once said:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:34.62,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Within a township of ten families, venerable sages are surely among them."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:37.38,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Why claim there are no men of talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:39.30,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Forgive my ignorance on this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.00,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I would like to be taught by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:48.98,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The marvelous prodigies of today are all already here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.98,0:06:53.52,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lord Xuande, you must go and ask for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:58.52,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Then I am fain to travel wherever they may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:06:59.14,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.27,0:07:03.09,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"Fledgling Phoenix"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:33.74,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sleeping Dragon and Fledgling Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:37.80,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With even one of the two, peace can be brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:43.48,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, might you tell me who Sleeping Dragon and Fledgling Phoenix are?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:45.72,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:53.75,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:58.09,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,It's getting late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.82,0:08:03.48,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,General, feel free to stay overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:06.56,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,There will be time to talk again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.04,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.04,0:08:09.50,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:38.86,Thinking,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,The reason why you have not yet \Naccomplished your great undertaking
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:43.60,Thinking,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,is because you lack virtuous sage men to assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:49.74,Thinking,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Sleeping Dragon and Fledgling Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.74,0:08:53.28,Thinking,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,With even one of the two, peace can be brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:09:04.28,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Zhao Yun searched without success for Liu Bei outside of Xiangyang City.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.28,0:09:08.98,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,From the east side of the Tan Creek, \Nhe saw water prints on the west side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:13.64,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He figured that Liu Bei came back to Xinye, so he went there with his men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.83,0:09:19.54,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The Heavens and the Earth are fickle...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:24.86,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}the fires extinguishing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:18.10,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Even after he went to Xinye, he did not find Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.10,0:09:20.36,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Zhao Yun worried,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.36,0:09:23.90,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,so he searched the western bank of the Tan Creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:26.33,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,At Mount Shuijing, he met Liu Bei,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.29,0:09:30.58,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}A house in brink of collapse...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:36.90,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}the lone piece of wood struggling to support it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.33,0:09:28.90,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,and the two headed back for Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.61,0:09:34.58,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Along the way, they found a man seeking to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.90,0:09:43.00,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}A wise man resides in mountains and valleys...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.00,0:09:48.60,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}seeking to serve a wise lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:54.40,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}A wise lord seeks the virtuous...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:10:03.04,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but does not know about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:05.64,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,"A wise lord seeks the virtuous..."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:07.18,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,"but does not know about me..."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:16.80,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Zilong, could that man be\N Sleeping Dragon or Fledging Phoenix?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:18.10,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:18.45,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:44.34,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,May I ask where you came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:57.75,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,From all around the mountains!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:09.26,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,May I ask for your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:16.74,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I am from Yingshang. \NOf the family {\i1}Shàn,{\i0} by the name of {\i1}Fú.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:20.74,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Sir, I heard that you are recruiting the virtuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:24.88,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Because you listened to my lament, you have earned my respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:31.20,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Thank you for your time, you have my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.61,0:11:32.79,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.30,0:11:35.50,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir, let us discuss this at a hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.50,0:11:43.64,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4780,5140)\pos(345.861,436.4)}Shàn Fú\N\N{\i1}True Name:{\i0} \NXú Shù\NStyled: Yuánzhí
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:41.45,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,That horse must be Dilü!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.94,0:11:59.44,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,This horse can handle a thousand {\i1}li{\i0} of travel, but it will curse its rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.44,0:12:00.99,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Sire, do not ride it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:06.34,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,This horse leaped over the Tan Creek!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:07.94,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,It saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.94,0:12:09.54,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How can it curse its rider?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.35,0:12:14.66,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,This horse will curse its master.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:23.08,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I have a way to avoid this problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:27.03,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Do speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.58,0:12:32.38,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Sire, if you have someone in mind you detest,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:34.88,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,you should give this horse to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:38.23,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Let the curse take effect, and then reclaim it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.13,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,No more problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:47.68,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I happened to hear your melody. It was out of the ordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:51.66,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Looking at you, you seemed to be a man of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.66,0:12:54.20,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I hoped you would help me achieve my noble cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:56.50,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Yet instead of showing me the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.50,0:12:58.48,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,you talk of wreaking petty harm!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:00.90,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir, you may find another lord instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.06,0:13:21.11,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I have long heard of your benevolent reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:24.52,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I was testing you, and I'm shown it was not empty talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:28.25,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I, Shan Fu, am willing to follow you to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:34.68,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How could I call myself benevolent? I only wish to seek your advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.60,0:13:37.38,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My lord, no need for humility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:40.48,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,The people of Xinye have sung this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.12,0:13:47.36,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,{\bord9.333\i1}"Xinye's Lord, Uncle Liu, \Nblessed is the land, where he would stand."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:53.34,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Because of your benevolence, \Nthe people place great faith in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.64,0:14:06.64,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I will appoint you as my Army Strategist, guiding my men to achieve great things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:11.64,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:25.41,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Since the fifth year of the Jian'an era,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:25.41,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,200 CE.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:29.44,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I raised a righteous army to \Ndestroy all the menaces of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.35,0:14:32.86,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I defeated Yuan Shao and retook four provinces!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:35.84,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I have pacified the Wuhuan tribes and appeased Liaodong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.84,0:14:38.26,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Now, with the north pacified,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:40.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I will again march my army!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.03,0:14:44.43,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Jīng-Xiāng (荆襄) aka. Jing Province and Xiangyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.94,0:14:44.98,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I will first take the lands of Jing-Xiang, then conquer Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:49.06,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Liu Bei had tried earlier to take the capital of Xu away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:52.86,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,While his wings are not developed, we must kill him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:54.56,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,to eliminate a future problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:56.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Generals, heed my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.94,0:14:57.68,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Cao Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.68,0:14:58.36,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.36,0:14:58.98,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Li Dian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:14:59.50,Default,Li Dian,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:00.25,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Lü Kuang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:00.69,Default,Lü Kuang,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:01.38,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Lü Xiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:01.95,Default,Lü Xiang,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:03.72,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,The four of you will advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.56,0:15:11.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5720,6040)\pos(324.015,463.227)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:07.94,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Take 30,000 troops under your command.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:12.20,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Garrison at Fancheng and scout Liu Biao's strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.10,Default,All,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:15.85,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Disperse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:29.87,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,We must speed up preparations to defend Fancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:32.54,Default,Lü Kuang,0,0,0,,General Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:38.40,Default,Lü Kuang,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has garrisoned at Xinye, building up his armies and supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.40,0:15:40.54,Default,Lü Kuang,0,0,0,,This suggests that he will take Xuchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:42.46,Default,Lü Kuang,0,0,0,,He is getting too bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:47.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5220,5580)\pos(315.169,510.356)}Lü Kuàng
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.20,0:15:47.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5220,5580)\pos(618.788,487.847)}Lü Xiáng
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:44.47,Default,Lü Kuang,0,0,0,,We must eliminate him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:49.48,Default,Lü Kuang,0,0,0,,Since we brothers joined the Chancellor, we have not made achievements,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:52.38,Default,Lü Kuang,0,0,0,,yet still receive the Chancellor's patronage.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:54.08,Default,Lü Kuang,0,0,0,,Now that we march to Fancheng,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:58.84,Default,Lü Kuang,0,0,0,,ask for 5,000 elite soldiers to seize Liu Bei's head and gift it to the Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:00.30,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:06.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6360,6720)\pos(989.392,494.141)}Cáo Rén\NStyled: Zǐxiào
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:05.50,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,I will let you two lead elite troops towards Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:06.96,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Liu Bei will be first to fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:08.06,Default,Lü Kuang & Lü Xiang,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.65,0:16:19.18,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother! Strategist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:20.14,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother! Strategist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.14,0:16:20.83,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,My lord! Strategist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:22.48,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:25.98,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Were Lü Kuang and Lü Xiang ever a match against us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:28.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,420,5120,5480)\pos(308.8,492.8)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:28.68,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Zilong and I cut them down under two rounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:31.40,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Great! You may sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.40,0:16:32.80,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Thank you, Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.23,0:16:36.56,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Strategist, your plan was ingenious!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:40.70,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Cao Cao sent Lü Kuang and Lü Xiang to invade Xinye,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.70,0:16:44.54,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,but with a single plan, \Nhe has now lost two of his warrior-generals!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.22,0:16:48.38,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,However, how can Cao Cao be willing to concede at this point?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:53.89,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Xinye only has a few soldiers. \NStrategist, how can we counter the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:56.76,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My lord, no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:17:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! A large army led by Cao Ren and \NLi Dian is coming towards Xinye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.47,0:17:08.10,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Because we defeated Lü Kuang and Lü Xiang,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:12.26,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,a furious Cao Ren has led his entire army to Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.00,0:17:14.81,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Fancheng must be empty then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.52,0:17:18.04,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,We must use this chance to take it over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.20,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Guan Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.20,0:17:21.60,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:22.75,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:23.54,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:27.08,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Both of you will lead one thousand \Nmen to meet the enemy at Fancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:34.73,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Generals, just follow these plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:36.06,Default,Guan Yu & Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.38,0:17:45.84,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Strategist, with their departure, how can we defend ourselvevs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:50.66,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,We will guard Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:53.00,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Zhao Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.60,0:17:54.00,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.36,0:17:57.98,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,General Zilong, you will accompany us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.98,0:17:59.32,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Await our command.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.59,0:18:00.52,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:39.00,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(967.471,458.665)}Cáo Rén\NStyled: Zǐxiào
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.89,0:19:00.44,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:05.18,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Li Dian is defeated! Signal the men to finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.11,0:19:08.15,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.18,0:19:10.86,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:17.20,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Heed my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.20,0:19:18.20,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Change formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:42.92,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.23,0:20:08.76,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.36,0:20:10.44,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:13.66,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir, why are you halting our attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:16.33,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My lord, watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.34,0:20:24.88,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,That is the {\i1}Golden Locks of Eight Gates Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:31.34,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Zilong rushed into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.48,0:20:55.21,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:01.39,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.88,0:21:37.43,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How are you, Zilong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.85,0:21:40.66,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,When I charged into them, a cloud of smoke rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:42.59,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,I couldn't find that Li Dian!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.59,0:21:45.44,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,The Cao army changed formation, encasing me in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.44,0:21:47.61,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,With much effort, I broke out,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:51.05,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,but none of my other troops survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:57.91,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,By the look of it, that formation is hard to break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:03.00,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,The Golden Locks of Eight Gates Formation has eight regiments and gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:06.20,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,They are tightly linked together without even a gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.07,0:22:11.05,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,If our troops rushed into them, they will fight a different soldier each time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:14.10,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,The formation has the men intersect with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.20,0:22:17.34,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,The formation never stops turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.34,0:22:20.15,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,They can hit you, but you cannot hit them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.30,0:22:25.90,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,If a soldier joins them, it will grow the cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.90,0:22:29.00,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,No matter how brave one may be, they will die to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:31.36,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,That is the strength of this formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.83,0:22:35.95,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,In that case, is there no plan that can defeat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.76,0:22:44.62,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Although they are grouped neatly, they lack a Supreme Ultimate;
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:46.62,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,their center has no commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:50.75,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,General, enter through the southeast corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.75,0:22:54.56,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,If you attack the western gate, they will rout.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.32,0:22:58.92,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Zilong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.25,0:23:01.86,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Do as he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.68,0:23:04.75,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Have your men maintain their flanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.75,0:23:05.52,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.77,0:23:13.46,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.48,0:23:40.24,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Pass my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.99,0:25:09.56,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,We have broken through them!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.22,0:25:14.08,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Pursue them!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.42,0:25:16.66,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.58,0:25:34.54,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir, you are truly extraordinary!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.97,0:25:36.44,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My lord, you flatter me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.97,0:25:41.62,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,You should order our troops not to pursue, but to return to camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.51,0:25:43.18,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.36,0:25:48.04,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,How could he have broken through our formation?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.04,0:25:51.31,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,We will raid Liu Bei's camp tonight while he's complacent from victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.31,0:25:52.35,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Victory is certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.06,0:25:53.96,Default,Li Dian,0,0,0,,General Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.98,0:25:57.10,Default,Li Dian,0,0,0,,There must be sage men helping Liu Bei now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.10,0:26:00.60,Default,Li Dian,0,0,0,,Now that our army is here, we must defend Fancheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.19,0:26:04.14,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,We will fall back if we don't succeed tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.74,0:26:07.20,Default,Li Dian,0,0,0,,Don't! Liu Bei must have prepared for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.52,0:26:09.74,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Armies aren't run by paranoia!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.49,0:26:34.12,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.38,0:26:49.62,Default,Zhao Yun,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.20,0:26:51.56,Default,Li Dian,0,0,0,,We've been outmaneuvered!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.88,0:26:53.34,Default,Cao Ren & Li Dian,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.60,0:27:00.57,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.86,0:27:26.56,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Cross the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.13,0:27:30.65,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Find a ferry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.92,0:27:38.24,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Find a ferry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.96,0:27:40.90,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Cao Ren, halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.90,0:27:43.08,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I've been waiting too long for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.64,0:27:45.04,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.35,0:27:47.94,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.21,0:27:59.40,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.44,0:28:23.14,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Open the gates! Cao Ren's army has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.96,0:28:33.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5360,5760)\pos(992,496)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.95,0:28:34.08,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Cao Ren, you boor! \NWe captured Fancheng hours ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.26,0:28:36.02,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.90,0:28:47.58,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Come, come! Let's drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.40,0:29:10.00,Default,All,0,0,0,,Strategist, thank you! Thank you, Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.04,0:29:20.27,Default,All,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.66,0:29:22.68,Default,All,0,0,0,,Drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.53,0:29:35.24,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Ever since this gentleman has joined us, we have been victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.16,0:29:40.34,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I always knew if I were to achieve my undertaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.34,0:29:43.22,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I would need talented sages like him by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.22,0:29:45.44,Default,All,0,0,0,,Correct, correct, correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.64,0:29:49.20,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir, please accept my bow!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.20,0:29:50.82,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My lord, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.23,0:29:54.51,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My lord, you flatter me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.59,0:29:57.50,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,You graced me with your patronage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.50,0:29:59.67,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I am merely repaying that, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.67,0:30:01.35,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I dare not receive such respect!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.78,0:30:07.34,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,With his assistance and your combined efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.34,0:30:09.61,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,how can our great cause not be realized?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.61,0:30:10.95,Default,All,0,0,0,,Another round!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.95,0:30:12.61,Default,All,0,0,0,,Come, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.61,0:30:14.68,Default,All,0,0,0,,We wish Your Lordship great fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.16,0:30:16.20,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.20,0:30:18.22,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Chancellor, we lost Fancheng!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.22,0:30:19.76,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,You may punish us!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.70,0:30:24.40,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Your pride led you to ignore warnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.40,0:30:25.96,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Thus you were defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.66,0:30:32.66,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Because of your past achievements,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.66,0:30:34.08,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I shall spare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.37,0:30:37.28,Default,Cao Ren & Li Dian,0,0,0,,We thank you for your mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.46,0:30:45.46,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Liu Bei was handily defeated at Runan by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.46,0:30:47.72,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,That was not long ago from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.30,0:30:51.60,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Now you get routed whenever you attack Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.52,0:30:55.76,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Even the Golden Locks of \NEight Gates Formation has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.16,0:31:05.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Liu Bei must have received a great talent to his ranks, planning his maneuvers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.74,0:31:07.06,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,Chancellor is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.78,0:31:10.92,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,I heard Liu Bei gained a judicious advisor, Shan Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.70,0:31:15.80,Default,Cao Ren,0,0,0,,He is the one who broke our formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.91,0:31:19.10,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Shan Fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.78,0:31:21.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What is he like?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.36,0:31:33.48,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,6720,7120)\pos(308.8,489.6)}Chéng Yù \NStyled: Zhòngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.66,0:31:30.90,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Chancellor, Shan Fu is a false name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.91,0:31:34.50,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,He is actually a man from Yingchuan
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.50,0:31:37.42,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,of the family {\i1}Xú,{\i0} by the name of {\i1}Shù,{\i0} styled {\i1}Yuánzhí.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.42,0:31:40.21,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,When he was young, he practiced swordsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.21,0:31:43.98,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,He is forthright by nature,\N and is fond of fighting against injustice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.52,0:31:49.72,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Near the end of the{\i1} Zhongping {\i0}calendar, he slew a corrupt official to avenge a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.56,0:31:49.42,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Zhōngpíng [中平], last era name of Emperor Ling, lasted from 184 CE to 189 CE.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.72,0:31:52.48,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,He had no choice but to go into hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.02,0:31:58.30,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,When he was arrested by officials, he was asked for his name, but did not reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.30,0:32:03.95,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,The officials tied him to a cart \Nand drummed in the streets to learn about his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.95,0:32:06.02,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,However, because of his heroic deeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.02,0:32:08.56,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,not a single person revealed his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.23,0:32:12.50,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,The officer could only put him in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.13,0:32:15.85,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Later, he had a friend who freed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.76,0:32:23.74,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Xu Shu then changed his name, \Nand has since devoted himself to learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.74,0:32:27.28,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,visiting famed teachers and became enriched with knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.88,0:32:32.93,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,He often meets with people like Sima Hui to discuss the current state of the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.31,0:32:43.10,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,So how does his talent compare to yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.46,0:32:47.02,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Ten times as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.55,0:32:52.57,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What a pity! What a pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.57,0:32:56.83,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Another talented man falls under Liu Bei's palms!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.83,0:33:01.49,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Now that his wings are fully developed, how can I not be concerned?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.28,0:33:07.31,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Although Xu Shu serves under Liu Bei,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.93,0:33:11.70,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,if you want him under your command, it can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.30,0:33:14.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What are you suggesting, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.77,0:33:18.33,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Xu Shu is a most filial man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.33,0:33:22.10,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,He lost his father in his youth, with only his mother at his household.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.10,0:33:24.50,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,With his younger brother Xu Kang dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.50,0:33:26.84,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,their mother has no one else to support her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.11,0:33:31.34,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Chancellor, you should invite her over to Xuchang
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.34,0:33:33.82,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,and have her summon her son with a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.76,0:33:37.60,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Xu Shu will certainly come!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.91,0:33:40.58,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.07,0:33:44.66,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Send someone to Yingchuan right away,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.95,0:33:48.07,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Bring Xu Shu's mother here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.73,0:33:54.44,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Why did you make me come to Xuchang?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.28,0:33:54.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(509.633,517.72)}Mother of Xú Shù
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.11,0:33:56.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.94,0:34:02.62,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I heard that your son, Xu Yuanzhi, \Nis a prodigy of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.73,0:34:08.96,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,However, he is assisting that rebel Liu Bei \Nin undermining the Imperial Court from Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.96,0:34:13.13,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Is it not as if beautiful jade fell into the mud? A great pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.59,0:34:21.04,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I asked you to come here in order for you to return him back to Xuchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.14,0:34:25.62,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I can petition the Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.62,0:34:27.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,to grant you a hefty reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.21,0:34:39.72,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Madam, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.40,0:34:43.92,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,What kind of man is Liu Bei?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.72,0:34:47.90,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,A lesser man from Zhuo Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.90,0:34:51.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,He claims to be the Imperial Uncle, but is treacherous to the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:56.24,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,As they say, a crook in gentleman's clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.40,0:35:00.40,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Why are you lying to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.40,0:35:05.50,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,I know Liu Xuande is a descendant\N of Prince Jing of Zhongshan
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.50,0:35:07.85,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,and of Emperor Jing of Han's lineage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.85,0:35:11.74,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,He treats the virtuous with utmost respect
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.74,0:35:14.22,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,and has built up a righteous reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.22,0:35:16.22,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,He is a hero of this age!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.86,0:35:20.42,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,My son is blessed to have such a wise lord to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.59,0:35:24.98,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,You may be the Chancellor of the Han,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.98,0:35:26.96,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,but you are its most vile traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.50,0:35:33.73,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,You slander Liu Xuande as a rebel to turn my son away from the light to the darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.73,0:35:36.45,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Have you no shame?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.58,0:35:38.72,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Out with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.72,0:35:39.90,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.90,0:35:40.66,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Behead her!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.66,0:35:41.62,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Hypocrite consul!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.06,0:35:44.45,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,No, stop the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.97,0:35:49.62,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,She insults your honor to get you to execute her!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.62,0:35:56.80,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,For if you kill her, it will worsen your reputation and instead make her a martyr.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.82,0:36:06.14,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,By killing her, Xu Shu will either commit suicide,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.14,0:36:08.90,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,or devote himself in full to Liu Bei to avenge her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.55,0:36:14.10,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,It is in our interest to let her live.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.10,0:36:17.04,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,This would tear Xu Shu apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.04,0:36:20.56,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Even if he stays with Liu Bei, he will lose all of his will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.56,0:36:22.62,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Let Xu Shu's mother remain here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.62,0:36:26.56,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,for I have yet another plan to make Xu Shu come.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.58,0:36:32.59,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.00,0:36:37.38,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Escort Xu Shu's mother elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.74,0:36:39.56,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.12,0:36:42.40,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Ma'am, how have you been lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.92,0:36:46.04,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Mister Cheng, you brought me something again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.04,0:36:46.54,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.54,0:36:47.12,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.23,0:37:01.69,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,When Yuanzhi and I studied together, we were like brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.69,0:37:05.22,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Thus madam, you are like a mother to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.22,0:37:05.63,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.10,0:37:06.62,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.82,0:37:12.10,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,However, now that Yuanzhi is not here by your side,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.10,0:37:15.12,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,I will be here for you in his stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.37,0:37:19.66,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Mister Cheng, you are a kind man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.66,0:37:23.06,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Yet, you have submitted to Cao Cao. How-
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.50,0:37:24.44,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.30,0:37:26.49,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.70,0:37:30.74,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Fate is unkind, I am powerless before it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.46,0:37:35.20,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,But when I get the chance, \NI will escort you back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.81,0:37:37.72,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.35,0:37:38.94,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.64,0:37:44.98,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,I have duties elsewhere, I regret I cannot stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.98,0:37:45.96,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.96,0:37:46.80,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.65,0:37:49.54,Default,Cheng Yu,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.54,0:37:50.37,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.26,0:37:58.96,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.94,0:38:02.28,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,Mister Cheng left you another letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.45,0:38:05.94,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Cheng Yu truly is a scholarly gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.94,0:38:07.73,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,What a gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.73,0:38:11.36,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,I have his letter, so I should reply to convey my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.62,0:38:12.98,Default,Xu Shu's Mother,0,0,0,,Fetch me pen and inkstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.98,0:38:13.64,Default,Maid,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.79,0:39:11.11,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,My lord, someone from Xuchang is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.11,0:39:14.40,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,He is asking where Shan Fu is, \Nfor he has something to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.99,0:39:18.64,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.97,0:39:26.12,Default,Attendant,0,0,0,,I am a servant of Madam Xu!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.12,0:39:28.64,Default,Attendant,0,0,0,,I have here a letter by her own hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.22,0:39:35.11,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.42,0:40:06.71,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir, what is it that has you worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.88,0:40:10.25,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Sire, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.65,0:40:22.83,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir, say what it is. Don't be so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.02,0:40:36.26,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Sire...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.23,0:40:42.02,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My real name is Xu Shu, styled Yuanzhi, of Yingchuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.06,0:40:47.04,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,When I went into hiding, I changed my name to Shan Fu.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.30,0:40:53.21,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I heard that Liu Jingsheng was \Nseeking advisors, so I visited him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.13,0:40:58.97,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,In discussing matters, I realized that he was inept.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.19,0:41:03.74,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Therefore, I left a letter of resignation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.56,0:41:09.76,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Overnight, I stayed with Master Sima Water Mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.76,0:41:14.54,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Master criticized me for not recognizing \Na sagacious lord, so he recommended you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.26,0:41:18.68,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I was fortunate to have your favor and use of my talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.96,0:41:24.12,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,But for this, now Cao Cao targets me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.52,0:41:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, my mother is now imprisoned in Xu, under Cao Cao's torment.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.48,0:41:35.94,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My mother wrote to ask for my company...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.74,0:41:39.95,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I have no other choice but to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.10,0:41:49.54,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,It isn't that I do not wish to serve you,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.36,0:41:53.80,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,it is that my beloved mother suffers in chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.80,0:41:56.98,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I must leave for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.87,0:42:06.74,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.29,0:42:11.10,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Love between mother and\Nson is the most innate of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.10,0:42:13.86,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi, do not consider me before her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.99,0:42:17.10,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,After you meet with your mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.87,0:42:21.15,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,it will not be too late to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.22,0:42:25.22,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My lord...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.60,0:42:31.18,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi, no need to leave just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.18,0:42:35.50,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I implore you to stay with me just this night!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.18,0:42:38.90,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I will bid you farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.18,0:42:41.62,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,My lord, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.62,0:42:42.38,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.69,0:42:48.25,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.26,0:42:52.54,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Xu Shu takes his leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.54,0:42:53.17,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.50,0:43:03.15,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.64,0:43:06.48,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi is a rare genius in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.48,0:43:10.23,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,However, he saw the ins and outs of our army in Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.23,0:43:13.33,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,If he goes to Cao Cao, his knowledge will be used.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.33,0:43:15.30,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,That would bear ill toward us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.45,0:43:19.96,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,My lord, you should persist. Do not let him leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.85,0:43:22.98,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,Cao Cao will see Yuanzhi did not join him,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.98,0:43:25.30,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,so he will surely kill his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.30,0:43:30.70,Default,Sima Hui,0,0,0,,When Yuanzhi hears of this, \Nhe will certainly desire vengeance!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.70,0:43:31.44,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.46,0:43:39.30,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}To kill a mother to keep \Nusing his son is an atrocity!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.60,0:43:45.88,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}To force him to stay and sever the bond of mother and son is depravity!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.46,0:43:49.75,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I would rather die than act out this atrocity!
Comment: 0,0:09:19.54,0:09:24.86,Note (Potential style?),Xu Shu,0,0,0,,The element of the Han dynasty was fire.

